concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-8a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8A(6) Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the NRA receives advice from the Gene Technology Regulator in response to a notice under this section within the period specified in the notice, the NRA must:  (a) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a decision on the application, reconsideration, or issue to which the notice relates; and  (b) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision." ;
    skos:definition "(6) If the NRA receives advice from the Gene Technology Regulator in response to a notice under this section within the period specified in the notice, the NRA must:  (a) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a decision on the application, reconsideration, or issue to which the notice relates; and  (b) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "78a37f3a4f60d15ff7b3dc8e6dfc48b0ca063174a03b1749de885fdd7ea88567" ;
    values:partOf concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-8a ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ensure advice from Gene Technology Regulator is taken into account in decision-making." ;
