doc:sch-1-sec-30c-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "30C(5) Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under section 30D in relation to a class of therapeutic goods, the Secretary is not required to notify the Regulator under this section in relation to an application for listing or registration of a therapeutic good belonging to that class." ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer .

concept:gene-technology-consequential-amendments-act-2000-sch-1-sec-30d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30D Secretary may seek advice about classes of GM products"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-30d ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology Regulator in relation to therapeutic goods that consist of, or that contain, a GM product belonging to a class of GM products specified in the request.  (2) A request for advice under subsection (1) must specify the matters to which the advice is to relate.  (3) If the Secretary requests advice from the Gene Technology Regulator under subsection (1), the Gene Technology Regulator  Schedule 1  Consequential amendments  may provide written advice in relation to the matters specified in the request.  (4) If the Gene Technology Regulator gives advice to the Secretary under subsection (3), the advice remains in force until it is withdrawn by the Gene Technology Regulator by written notice given to the Secretary." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology Regulator in relation to therapeutic goods that consist of, or that contain, a GM product belonging to a class of GM products specified in the request.  (2) A request for advice under subsection (1) must specify the matters to which the advice is to relate.  (3) If the Secretary requests advice from the Gene Technology Regulator under subsection (1), the Gene Technology Regulator  Schedule 1  Consequential amendments  may provide written advice in relation to the matters specified in the request.  (4) If the Gene Technology Regulator gives advice to the Secretary under subsection (3), the advice remains in force until it is withdrawn by the Gene Technology Regulator by written notice given to the Secretary."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2d50751445b8daa4c4f157126beb49c070e1eab21856aee9cf238420100884c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
